<title>BRAZIL: Brazil govt to auction 85,800 bags coffee August 6.</title>
<headline>Brazil govt to auction 85,800 bags coffee August 6.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government is to auction 85,800 60-kg bags of coffee from its stocks at a regular monthly auction on August 6, said a statement from Banco do Brasil, which is to hold the electronic sale.</p>
<p>Members of the domestic roasting and soluble coffee industry as well as exporters can participate in the auction.</p>
<p>Details of the coffees included in the auction are as follows. Quantity is in bags:</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	 COLOR	 LOCATION	  TYPE</p>
<p>    7,500    1987/88    Yellowish    Varginha, MG	 6</p>
<p>    5,060	--	 Yellowish    Londrina, PR     6/7</p>
<p>    7,940	--	 Yellowish    Londrina, PR	 6</p>
<p>    5,000    1987/88    Yellowish    Rolandia, PR     6/7</p>
<p>    9,000    1987/88    Yellowish    Nova Fatima, PR    6</p>
<p>   23,000    1988/89    Greenish     Nova Fatima, PR    6</p>
<p>	480    1988/89    Typical	Nova Fatima, PR    7</p>
<p>    6,716    1988/89    Yellowish    Barueri, SP	  6</p>
<p>    4,103    1986/87    Yellowish    Catanduva, SP	6</p>
<p>    4,270    1986/87    Yellowish    Catanduva, SP	6</p>
<p>    1,455    1987/88    Yellowish    Catanduva, SP	6</p>
<p>	946    1987/88    Yellowish    Catanduva, SP	6</p>
<p>    4,339    1987/88    Yellowish    Oswaldo Cruz, SP   6</p>
<p>    5,991    1987/88    Yellowish    Oswaldo Cruz, SP   6</p>
<p>TOTAL - 85,800 bags</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417))</p>
